<section class="policy-page">
  <div class="policy-inner">

    <div class="policy-body">

      <!-- SHIPPING -->
      <div class="policy-section">
        <h2 class="policy-section-title">Shipping</h2>
        <div class="policy-section-body">
          <p><strong>Preorder fulfillment:</strong> Shinsei Line operates on a preorder model. Estimated fulfillment is 8–12 weeks from the close of the preorder window. This timeline reflects the production of each limited run and is not a guaranteed delivery date — unforeseen delays in production or shipping may occur, and we will communicate any significant changes as they arise.</p>
          <p><strong>Shipping coverage:</strong> We currently ship within the United States and to select international destinations. If your location isn't available at checkout, it isn't yet supported.</p>
          <p><strong>Duties, taxes, and customs:</strong> For international orders, the customer is solely responsible for any import duties, taxes, or customs fees assessed by the destination country. These are not included in your order total and are collected separately, typically by the shipping carrier or customs authority upon arrival. Shinsei Line has no control over these fees and cannot predict their amount.</p>
          <p><strong>Address accuracy:</strong> Please ensure your shipping address is correct at checkout. We are not responsible for orders delayed or lost due to incorrect address information provided by the customer.</p>
          <p><strong>Tracking:</strong> Once your order ships, you will receive a confirmation email with tracking information.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- RETURNS & REFUNDS -->
      <div class="policy-section">
        <h2 class="policy-section-title">Returns &amp; Refunds</h2>
        <div class="policy-section-body">
          <p>All sales are final.</p>
          <p>Given the limited, made-to-order nature of each release, Shinsei Line does not accept returns or exchanges once an order has shipped.</p>
          <p><strong>Damaged or defective items:</strong> If your order arrives damaged or with a manufacturing defect, contact us within 48 hours of delivery at <a href="mailto:shinseilineofficial@gmail.com">shinseilineofficial@gmail.com</a>, including your order number and photos of the issue. Claims submitted after this window cannot be guaranteed review. Approved claims will be resolved via repair, replacement, or store credit, at our discretion, depending on availability.</p>
          <p><strong>Order cancellations:</strong> Once an order is placed, it enters production planning immediately and cannot be modified or cancelled.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- PRIVACY POLICY -->
      <div class="policy-section">
        <h2 class="policy-section-title">Privacy Policy</h2>
        <div class="policy-section-body">
          <p class="policy-section-updated">Last updated: August 31, 2026</p>
          <p>Shinsei Line ("we," "us," "our"), a DBA of Menacity LLC, respects your privacy. This policy explains what personal information we collect, how we use it, and your choices.</p>
          <p><strong>Information we collect:</strong></p>
          <p>Information you provide directly: name, email address, shipping/billing address, and payment information when you make a purchase, sign up for our email list, or contact us. Payment information is processed securely by Shopify and our payment processor — we do not store your full payment card details.</p>
          <p>Information collected automatically: we use cookies and similar technologies (including advertising pixels, where installed) to understand how visitors use our site, which supports basic site functionality and helps us understand the effectiveness of our marketing.</p>
          <p><strong>How we use your information:</strong></p>
          <p>To fulfill and communicate about your orders. To respond to customer service inquiries. To send updates about upcoming releases, if you've opted in. To understand and improve how our site is used.</p>
          <p><strong>Third parties:</strong> We share information with service providers who help us operate our business — including Shopify (our e-commerce platform), our payment processor, and shipping carriers. We do not sell your personal information.</p>
          <p><strong>Your rights:</strong> If you are a California resident, you may have rights under California law regarding your personal information, including the right to know what information we've collected and to request its deletion. To make a request, contact us at <a href="mailto:shinseilineofficial@gmail.com">shinseilineofficial@gmail.com</a>.</p>
          <p><strong>Data retention:</strong> We retain your information for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes described in this policy, or as required by law.</p>
          <p><strong>Contact:</strong> Questions about this policy can be directed to <a href="mailto:shinseilineofficial@gmail.com">shinseilineofficial@gmail.com</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- TERMS OF SERVICE -->
      <div class="policy-section">
        <h2 class="policy-section-title">Terms of Service</h2>
        <div class="policy-section-body">
          <p class="policy-section-updated">Last updated: August 31, 2026</p>
          <p>By accessing or using theshinseiline.com (the "Site"), operated by Shinsei Line, a DBA of Menacity LLC, you agree to the following terms.</p>
          <p><strong>Eligibility:</strong> You must be at least 18 years old, or the age of majority in your jurisdiction, to make a purchase on this Site.</p>
          <p><strong>Products and availability:</strong> All products are offered in limited quantities. We reserve the right to limit quantities, refuse or cancel orders, and modify or discontinue products at any time without notice.</p>
          <p><strong>Pricing:</strong> All prices are listed in USD and are subject to change without notice. We are not liable for any typographical errors in pricing.</p>
          <p><strong>Intellectual property:</strong> All content on this Site — including but not limited to designs, graphics, logos, and text — is the property of Shinsei Line/Menacity LLC and may not be reproduced, distributed, or used without written permission.</p>
          <p><strong>Limitation of liability:</strong> To the fullest extent permitted by law, Shinsei Line is not liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of this Site or purchase of our products.</p>
          <p><strong>Governing law:</strong> These terms are governed by the laws of the State of California, without regard to conflict of law principles.</p>
          <p><strong>Changes to these terms:</strong> We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the Site after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.</p>
          <p><strong>Contact:</strong> Questions about these terms can be directed to <a href="mailto:shinseilineofficial@gmail.com">shinseilineofficial@gmail.com</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

